    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_PRIMARY_WHIP_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Pierce</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_PRIMARY_WHIP_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Agile</style>. <color=#9933CC>Aerial</color>. Fire a short-range, infinitely piercing beam for <style=cIsDamage>200% damage</style> with a 50% chance to apply <color=#9933CC>Shadowflame</color>.",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SECONDARY_GUN_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Shadowshot</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SECONDARY_GUN_DESCRIPTION": "Shoot a spectral arrow, dealing <style=cIsDamage>540% damage</style>. On-hit, creates a black hole that pulls in nearby enemies. If used while gliding, redirects your momentum towards the shot.",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SPECIAL_PILLAR_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Rupture</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SPECIAL_PILLAR_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Agile</style>. <color=#9933CC>Aerial</color>. Conjure a beam of energy, dealing <style=cIsDamage>700% damage</style> to all enemies inside over 0.5 seconds. Aiming at nearby terrain summons a larger pillar that does <style=cIsDamage>twice as much damage.</style>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_UTILITY_WARP_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Nova Warp</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_UTILITY_WARP_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#9933CC>Aerial</color>. <style=cIsUtility>Warp a short distance</style>, detonating on ending for <style=cIsDamage>600% damage</style>. Holds 2 charges.",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_UTILITY_LAUNCH_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Second Wind</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_UTILITY_LAUNCH_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#9933CC>Aerial</color>. <style=cIsUtility>Launch yourself into the air</style>, fully restoring flight time.",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SPECIAL_WELL_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Gravity Well</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SPECIAL_WELL_DESCRIPTION": "Create a pocket dimension around yourself, repeatedly dealing <style=cIsDamage>160% damage</style> to all enemies inside, scaling with attack speed. Has a small chance to apply <color=#9933CC>Shadowflame</color> on-hit.",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SPECIAL_RAM_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Living Comet</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SPECIAL_RAM_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#9933CC>Aerial</color>. <style=cIsUtility>Heavy</style>. Surge forward for 1.5 seconds, gaining 10% barrier and dealing <style=cIsDamage>200 - 2500% damage</style> to enemies you run into, scaling with movement speed. <color=#9933CC>Applies Shadowflame</color>. Holds 2 charges.",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SCEPTER_WELL_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Subsume</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SCEPTER_WELL_DESCRIPTION": "Create a pocket dimension around yourself, pulling nearby enemies towards the center and repeatedly dealing <style=cIsDamage>160% damage</style> to all enemies inside, scaling with attack speed. Has a small chance to apply <color=#9933CC>Shadowflame</color> on-hit. At the end, implode for <style=cIsDamage>400% damage</style>.",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SCEPTER_RAM_NAME": "<color=#9933CC>Arcane Comet</color>",
    "FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_SCEPTER_RAM_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#9933CC>Aerial</color>. <style=cIsUtility>Heavy</style>. Restores half of flight time. Surge forward for 1.5 seconds, extended by 0.5 for each bash, gaining 20% barrier and dealing <style=cIsDamage>200 - 2500% damage</style> to enemies you run into, scaling with movement speed. <color=#9933CC>Applies Shadowflame</color>. Holds 3 charges.",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Sorceress: Mastery",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_FROSTHEX_ASTERIA_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "As Sorceress, beat the game or obliterate on Monsoon.",
